---
metadata: {
    partial_name: "Sign In | Claim Slot",
}
---
{%- comment -%}
  Tries to claim one exact slot. Called by take_slot.liquid:
    function claimed = 'account/sign_in/claim_slot', table: table, external_id: external_id
  Returns true when this request created the slot, false when it already existed.
  external_id is unique per table, so of two requests racing for one slot, exactly one wins.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  graphql slot = 'account/sign_in/claim_slot', table: table, external_id: external_id
  if slot.record_create.id != blank
    return true
  endif
  return false
-%}
